#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:1
msgid "Upgrade notes"
msgstr "升级说明"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:3
msgid ""
"What an operator upgrading an existing deployment needs to know about "
"recent schema migrations. New installations start from an empty database "
"and can skip this page. The deployment order itself, and how to roll "
"back, are in [rolling deployment order](operations.md#rolling-deployment-"
"order) and [deployment reliability](deployment-reliability.md)."
msgstr ""
"升级已有部署时，运维人员需要了解的近期 schema "
"迁移信息都在这里。全新安装从空数据库开始，可以跳过这一页。部署的先后顺序和回滚方法，见[滚动部署顺序](operations.md"
"#rolling-deployment-order)和[部署可靠性](deployment-reliability.md)。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:9
msgid "Before starting this release"
msgstr "启动本次发布之前"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:11
msgid ""
"Before starting this release, run `alembic upgrade head` through "
"`0095_memory_retention`. The supported deployment scripts run migrations "
"before replacing the API; every migration listed here is additive and "
"safe under the running previous release unless it says otherwise. The few"
" transitions that need stopped writers are listed in [applying migrations"
" that are not backwards-compatible](operations.md#applying-migrations-"
"that-are-not-backwards-compatible)."
msgstr ""
"启动本次发布之前，先运行 `alembic upgrade head`，升级到 "
"`0095_memory_retention`。官方支持的部署脚本会在替换 API "
"之前执行迁移；除非下面特别说明，这里列出的每个迁移都只做增量修改，上一个发布还在运行时执行也是安全的。少数几个需要先停掉所有写入的迁移，列在[执行不向后兼容的迁移](operations.md"
"#applying-migrations-that-are-not-backwards-compatible)里。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:18
msgid ""
"After migrating, start the main control-plane listener with its existing "
"complete environment: it imports newly registered settings once, as "
"described in [Admin Settings](operations.md#admin-settings)."
msgstr ""
"迁移完成后，用现有的完整环境变量启动主控制平面监听器：它会把新注册的设置项导入一次，具体见 [Admin "
"Settings](operations.md#admin-settings)。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:22
msgid "Conversation history read contract"
msgstr "对话历史读取协议"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:24
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This release changes `GET /v1/agent/jobs/{job_id}/thread` to "
"`history_version: 2`. Deploy the frontend with the API: the existing "
"message/job arrays and their chronological order remain, but they are a "
"bounded page rather than the whole conversation. Small histories remain "
"complete. The default page contains at most 50 turn/message entries, the "
"maximum `limit` is 100, and the serialized response is at most 512 KiB. "
"`current_job_id` identifies the newest turn independently of the page; "
"`anchor=true` starts at the selected job instead."
msgstr ""
"本次发布将 `GET /v1/agent/jobs/{job_id}/thread` 改为 `history_version: 2`。前端必须与 "
"API 一起部署：原有的消息和 job 数组及其时间顺序不变，但返回的是有界的一页，不再是整个对话。较短的历史仍会完整返回。每页默认最多包含 50"
" 条轮次或消息记录，`limit` 最大为 100，序列化响应最多为 512 KiB。`current_job_id` "
"独立于分页标识最新轮次；设置 `anchor=true` 则从选中的 job 开始读取。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:32
msgid ""
"Pass `next_cursor` as `cursor` to load older history explicitly. For "
"refreshes, retain older pages and pass `sync_cursor` as `after`; follow "
"each returned `next_cursor` as `after` until it is null. This rereads the"
" two mutable tail turns so an in-flight write cannot disappear behind a "
"newly allocated ID. Merge messages by ID and jobs by ID/revision, "
"preserving turn order and placing each opening prompt before its replies "
"and mid-turn messages. Cursors are scoped to the owned, undeleted "
"conversation on every request."
msgstr ""
"将 `next_cursor` 作为 `cursor` 传入，按需加载更早的历史。刷新时保留已加载的旧页，将 `sync_cursor` 作为 "
"`after` 传入，再把每次返回的 `next_cursor` 继续作为 `after` 传入，直到它为 "
"null。这样会重读末尾两个仍可能变化的轮次，避免尚未提交的写入落在新分配的 ID 之前而被漏掉。消息按 ID 合并，job 按 ID "
"和版本合并，保留轮次顺序，并将每轮的起始提示放在回复和轮中消息之前。每次请求都会检查游标属于当前所有者且对话未被删除。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:40
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Messages longer than 4,096 Unicode characters carry `content_truncated` "
"and `next_offset`. Read more through `GET "
"/v1/agent/jobs/{job_id}/thread/messages/{message_id}?offset=...`; each "
"request returns at most 16,384 characters and offsets count Unicode "
"characters, not UTF-8 bytes or JavaScript UTF-16 units. `thread_preview` "
"marks a job whose wide fields need the existing single-job detail read. A"
" false `pending_messages_complete` means read the unchanged queue "
"endpoint, `GET /v1/agent/threads/{thread_id}/messages`; an omitted queue "
"snapshot is not an empty queue. This changes the owner-facing read API "
"only, never runtime session recovery or transcript replay."
msgstr ""
"超过 4,096 个 Unicode 字符的消息会带上 `content_truncated` 和 `next_offset`。通过 `GET "
"/v1/agent/jobs/{job_id}/thread/messages/{message_id}?offset=...` "
"继续读取；每次请求最多返回 16,384 个字符，偏移量按 Unicode 字符计算，而不是 UTF-8 字节或 JavaScript "
"UTF-16 单元。job 带有 `thread_preview` 时，需要通过现有的单个 job "
"详情接口读取被省略的长字段。`pending_messages_complete` 为 false 时，改用未变更的队列接口 `GET "
"/v1/agent/threads/{thread_id}/messages`；省略队列快照不代表队列为空。这只改变面向所有者的读取 "
"API，不影响运行时会话恢复或转录回放。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:51
msgid "Recent migrations"
msgstr "近期迁移"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:53
msgid "Newest first."
msgstr "新的排在前面。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "Migration"
msgstr "迁移"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "What it changes"
msgstr "改了什么"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0095_memory_retention`"
msgstr "`0095_memory_retention`"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Builds partial archived-time and non-null superseded-by indexes "
"concurrently, without changing memory rows or the 90-day retention "
"policy. Online builds avoid blocking foreground writes; interrupted "
"builds can be retried. Offline SQL uses ordinary index builds. Downgrade "
"drops only these indexes."
msgstr "并发创建归档时间和非空 superseded_by 的部分索引，不修改记忆行或 90 天保留规则。在线构建不阻塞前台写入；中断后可以重试。离线 SQL 使用普通索引构建。降级只删除这些索引。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0094_thread_message_pages`"
msgstr "`0094_thread_message_pages`"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Builds a concurrent index on each job's messages in the existing prompt-"
"first order, so history pages seek a bounded set of message IDs before "
"reading bodies. Changes no row. An interrupted online build is dropped "
"and retried; offline conversion builds the index plainly inside its "
"transaction. A downgrade drops the index concurrently."
msgstr ""
"按现有的起始提示优先顺序，为每个 job 的消息并发建立索引，使历史分页先定位数量有上限的消息 "
"ID，再读取正文。不修改任何行。在线建索引中断后，会删除该索引再重试；离线转换则在事务内普通建索引。降级会并发删除索引。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0093_recent_requests`"
msgstr "`0093_recent_requests`"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Adds an owner/time-indexed projection of eligible recent requests and "
"message/thread maintenance triggers. Backfills existing eligible messages"
" once; trigger installation holds write-conflicting locks while the "
"backfill runs, so schedule for a low-write period on a large history. "
"Source messages are unchanged. Downgrade removes only the projection and "
"triggers."
msgstr ""
"新增按 owner "
"和时间索引的近期请求投影，以及消息和会话维护触发器。一次性回填已有的符合条件的消息；安装触发器后，回填期间持有与写入冲突的锁，历史较大时应安排在写入较少的时段执行。原始消息不变。降级只删除投影和触发器。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0092_targeted_work_wakes`"
msgstr "`0092_targeted_work_wakes`"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Replaces the `agent_work_available` trigger function so that its "
"notification names the one host that can take a retained conversation's "
"turn, and only that host's waiting runner is woken. It changes no table "
"or row. A control plane from the previous release ignores the name and "
"wakes every host, as before. A downgrade restores the empty notification."
msgstr ""
"替换 `agent_work_available` 的触发器函数：通知里会点名唯一能接手某个保留对话轮次的主机，只有这台主机上等待中的 "
"runner 会被唤醒。不改动任何表或行。上一版本的控制平面会忽略这个名字，像以前一样唤醒所有主机。降级会恢复为不带名字的通知。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0091_env_queued_runs_index`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Builds a partial index on `agent_environment_runs` concurrently, holding "
"only the runs still queued for a Host to claim. Idle environment-capable "
"Hosts claim every few seconds and the prebuild maintenance pass repeats "
"its scan; without the index every claim read the table's whole test and "
"prebuild history, which no partial index covered since `0078`. It reads "
"the run history without blocking the running API's inserts, and an "
"interrupted build leaves an invalid index that the next run drops and "
"rebuilds. Offline SQL builds it plainly instead, because a conversion "
"transaction cannot run a concurrent build. Changes no row. A downgrade "
"drops the index concurrently; runs already claimed stay claimed."
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0090_user_model_preferences`"
msgstr "`0090_user_model_preferences`"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Adds an empty table holding each owner's pinned default model for new "
"tasks. It changes no existing row; owners without a pin keep following "
"the model their last task used, and the administrator's default model is "
"a setting rather than a column. A downgrade drops the pins only."
msgstr ""
"新增一张空表，保存每位 owner 为新任务指定的默认模型。不修改任何已有行；没有指定的 owner "
"仍然跟随上次任务使用的模型，而管理员默认模型是设置项、不是表字段。降级只删除这些指定。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0089_superseded_removals`"
msgstr "`0089_superseded_removals`"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Adds an empty table recording each authorization to remove a container "
"that a moved sandbox group left behind on a Host being released, and when"
" the Host confirmed the removal. It changes no existing rows. A downgrade"
" drops the records; containers already removed stay removed."
msgstr ""
"新增一张空表：要释放某台 Host 时，已搬走的沙箱组在这台 Host 上留下的容器，每一次被授权删除都记在这里，Host "
"确认删掉的时间也记在这里。不改动任何已有的行。降级会删掉这些记录，但已经删掉的容器不会回来。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0088_sandbox_retry_budget`"
msgstr "`0088_sandbox_retry_budget`"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Adds the automatic deletion retry window and attempt count. Existing "
"pending requests begin their 24-hour window at their request time; "
"retries stop after eight claims with bounded backoff. An administrator "
"resumes an archived terminal request under its existing request ID and "
"verified receipt. A terminal prearchive request is atomically replaced "
"through the authorized deletion path, giving the host a fresh archive "
"identity after an acknowledged abort."
msgstr ""
"新增自动删除重试的时间窗口和尝试次数。已经在等待的请求，24 "
"小时窗口从各自的请求时间算起；认领满八次后不再重试，重试间隔有上限。管理员恢复一个已归档、已停止重试的请求时，沿用原来的请求 ID "
"和已核实的回执。还没归档就停止的请求，会通过经过授权的删除流程原子地换成一个新请求，这样主机在确认中止之后，拿到的是一个新的归档标识。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0087_sandbox_deletion_attempts`"
msgstr "`0087_sandbox_deletion_attempts`"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "Adds the admin-only, secret-free attempt history for sandbox deletion."
msgstr "新增沙箱删除的尝试记录，只有管理员能看到，不含任何密钥。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0086_conversation_read_receipts`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Adds an empty table for each owner's latest read completion per "
"conversation, with revision and job/attempt indexes for incremental "
"polling and foreign-key cleanup. It changes no existing rows and takes "
"brief foreign-key definition locks on the referenced tables. Existing "
"browser receipts import when that browser next opens the updated UI; a "
"downgrade drops cloud receipts but leaves browser caches intact."
msgstr ""
"新增一张空表，记录每个所有者在每个对话里最近读到的那次完成，并带有版本号索引和 job/attempt "
"索引，分别用于增量轮询和外键清理。它不改动任何现有行，只会在被引用的表上短暂持有外键定义锁。现有的浏览器回执，会在那个浏览器下次打开更新后的界面时导入；降级会丢掉云端的回执，但浏览器缓存不受影响。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0085_terminal_resume_index`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Builds a partial index on `agent_jobs` concurrently, holding only the "
"turns whose terminals still wait to resume. It reads the whole job "
"history without blocking the running API; an interrupted run can simply "
"be repeated. Changes no row."
msgstr ""
"在 `agent_jobs` 上以并发方式建一个部分索引，只收录终端还在等待恢复的轮次。它会读完整个任务历史，但不会阻塞正在运行的 "
"API；如果中途中断，直接重跑即可。不改动任何行。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0084_host_removal_move_out`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Adds `agent_runner_hosts.removal_moves_out` and `removal_leaves_unmoved`,"
" false for every existing host, so a removal already pending keeps its "
"earlier meaning: revoke once its running turns end."
msgstr ""
"新增 `agent_runner_hosts.removal_moves_out` 和 "
"`removal_leaves_unmoved`，所有已有主机上都是 "
"false。这样已经在等待中的移除仍保持原来的含义：等正在运行的轮次结束后，再撤销这台主机。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0083_host_move_out`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Adds the `move_out` purpose to the admission-hold check constraint. "
"Changes no existing row. Its downgrade deletes any move-out holds; groups"
" already moved keep their checkpoints."
msgstr "给准入限制的检查约束加上 `move_out` 这种用途。不改动任何已有数据。降级时会删除所有迁出用的限制；已经迁走的沙箱组保留各自的检查点。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0082_team_environments`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Adds nullable team columns to environments and their bindings, and lets a"
" repository default name any environment. Changes no existing row. Its "
"downgrade refuses while a team environment exists, archived ones "
"included."
msgstr "给环境和环境绑定加上可为空的团队列，并允许仓库的默认设置指向任意一个环境。不改动任何已有数据。只要还存在团队环境（包括已归档的），降级就会被拒绝。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0081_snapshot_pushed_commit`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Adds `agent_sandbox_snapshots.pushed_commit_sha` and copies into it the "
"commit of every snapshot that was never published. `published_commit_sha`"
" is left as it was, so the API it replaces keeps working, and no notice "
"fires."
msgstr ""
"新增 `agent_sandbox_snapshots.pushed_commit_sha`，并把每个从未发布过的快照的 commit "
"复制进去。`published_commit_sha` 保持原样，所以依赖它的旧 API 照常可用，也不会触发任何通知。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0080_user_ssh_servers`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Adds the owner SSH server tables; see [SSH servers](operations.md#ssh-"
"servers). Changes no existing row."
msgstr "新增所有者 SSH 服务器相关的表，见 [SSH 服务器](operations.md#ssh-servers)。不改动任何已有数据。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0079_teams`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Adds teams: members, single-use invitations, join requests and the team "
"audit log. Nothing else refers to a team yet, so it changes no existing "
"row and nothing anyone can run or read."
msgstr "新增团队相关的表：成员、一次性邀请、加入申请和团队审计日志。目前还没有别的地方引用团队，所以它不改动任何已有数据，也不影响任何人能运行或看到的内容。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0078_environment_snapshots`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Adds environment installation snapshots and the setup fingerprint on "
"environment bindings that decides which snapshot a workspace may start "
"from; see [environment installation snapshots](operations.md#environment-"
"installation-snapshots)."
msgstr ""
"新增环境安装快照，并在环境绑定上加了 setup 指纹，用来决定一个工作区可以从哪个快照启动；见[环境安装快照](operations.md"
"#environment-installation-snapshots)。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0077_sandbox_usage_days`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Adds the per-day container usage table and an owner index on "
"`agent_sandboxes`, built without `CONCURRENTLY`. That table holds one row"
" per retained container, so the brief write lock is short."
msgstr ""
"新增按天统计的容器用量表，并在 `agent_sandboxes` 上建一个所有者索引，建索引时没有用 "
"`CONCURRENTLY`。这张表每个保留容器只有一行，所以短暂的写锁很快就会释放。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0076_mcp_residency_fence`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Adds a nullable residency generation to MCP approval records; existing "
"approvals keep it empty."
msgstr "给 MCP 审批记录加上一个可为空的 residency 代次；已有的审批记录这一列为空。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0075_runtime_upgrades`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Adds two empty JSON columns for agent updates from the admin Settings "
"page."
msgstr "新增两个空的 JSON 列，用于从管理员设置页面升级 agent。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0074_host_removal_pending`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Adds `agent_runner_hosts.removal_requested_at`, empty for every existing "
"host. A downgrade drops it and leaves a host that was waiting to be "
"removed draining."
msgstr ""
"新增 "
"`agent_runner_hosts.removal_requested_at`，所有已有主机这一列都为空。降级会删掉这一列，原本在等待移除的主机会停留在排空状态。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0073_sandbox_restore`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Adds the `cold` and `restoring` sandbox states and the start fence that "
"binds a checkpoint to the run it ends; see [restoring a removed host's "
"sandboxes](operations.md#restoring-a-removed-hosts-sandboxes). Existing "
"checkpoints carry no fence and never move a group. Its downgrade refuses "
"while any group is cold or restoring."
msgstr ""
"新增 `cold` 和 `restoring` "
"两种沙箱状态，以及启动栅栏，把检查点和它所终结的那次运行绑在一起；见[恢复被移除主机上的沙箱](operations.md#restoring-a"
"-removed-hosts-sandboxes)。已有的检查点不带栅栏，永远不会让沙箱组迁移。只要还有沙箱组处于 cold 或 "
"restoring，降级就会被拒绝。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0072_drop_old_memory_tables`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Drops the retired memory tables. A rollback to before `0070` finds them "
"empty, without the earlier memory's portraits and preferences."
msgstr "删除已经退役的记忆相关的表。如果回滚到 `0070` 之前，会发现这些表是空的，旧版记忆里的头像和偏好都没了。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0071_temporary_workspaces`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Drops `NOT NULL` from `agent_threads.repo` and "
"`agent_environment_bindings.repo`, so conversations can start without a "
"repository. Its downgrade refuses while any such conversation exists."
msgstr ""
"去掉 `agent_threads.repo` 和 `agent_environment_bindings.repo` 上的 `NOT "
"NULL`，让对话可以不关联仓库直接开始。只要存在这样的对话，降级就会被拒绝。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0070_memory_cutover`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Moves the memory switches and saved preferences onto the durable-memory "
"table."
msgstr "把记忆功能的开关和已保存的偏好，搬到持久记忆表里。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0069_agent_memories`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "Adds the durable-memory table."
msgstr "新增持久记忆表。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0067_failed_snapshot_wake`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "Only replaces a trigger function."
msgstr "只替换了一个触发器函数。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0066_admin_job_listing_index`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Builds an index on `agent_jobs` concurrently. On a long job history it "
"takes a while without blocking the running API; an interrupted run can "
"simply be repeated."
msgstr "在 `agent_jobs` 上以并发方式建索引。任务历史很长时会花一些时间，但不会阻塞正在运行的 API；如果中途中断，直接重跑即可。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0051_host_drain_fence_epoch`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Backfills a non-null drain-fence epoch for every host. The database "
"rotates that epoch whenever drain-relevant lifecycle, credential, "
"placement or ownership state changes. Once the V2 control plane is "
"activated, this revision and the `AGENT_DEPLOY_DRAIN_FENCE_V2` recipe "
"marker are the application and schema rollback floor; see [rollback "
"compatibility](operations.md#rollback-compatibility)."
msgstr ""
"给每台主机回填一个非空的排空栅栏 epoch。之后只要与排空相关的生命周期、凭据、放置或归属状态发生变化，数据库就会轮换这个 epoch。V2 "
"控制平面激活之后，这个修订和 recipe 标记 `AGENT_DEPLOY_DRAIN_FENCE_V2` 就是应用和 schema "
"回滚的底线；见[回滚兼容性](operations.md#rollback-compatibility)。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0049_host_drain_fence`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Starts every existing host without a deployment drain owner or release "
"receipt. The V1 marker it introduced remains only so an older "
"orchestrator can perform the bridge upgrade; it is not a rollback target "
"after V2 activation."
msgstr ""
"让每台已有主机都从\"没有部署排空所有者、也没有释放回执\"的状态开始。它引入的 V1 标记只留给旧版编排器做过渡升级用；V2 "
"激活之后，就不能再回滚到它了。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0048_sandbox_plugins`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Adds `agent_threads.plugins`; existing chats default to no plugins. "
"Rebuild the sandbox image so the updated CLI wrappers load selected "
"plugins."
msgstr "新增 `agent_threads.plugins`，已有对话默认不带插件。需要重新构建沙箱镜像，让更新后的 CLI 包装脚本能加载所选的插件。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0046_job_claim_retry`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Adds `agent_jobs.claim_retry_at`, which the worker claim query requires. "
"Existing queued jobs remain immediately eligible."
msgstr "新增 `agent_jobs.claim_retry_at`，worker 的认领查询要用到它。已经在排队的任务仍可立即被认领。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:91
msgid ""
"Older revisions that need a maintenance window are listed in [applying "
"migrations that are not backwards-compatible](operations.md#applying-"
"migrations-that-are-not-backwards-compatible). A database still stamped "
"with the retired pre-2026-09-10 chain cannot be upgraded directly; see "
"[preserving an old-chain database](operations.md#preserving-an-old-chain-"
"database)."
msgstr ""
"更早的、需要停机维护窗口的修订，列在[执行不向后兼容的迁移](operations.md#applying-migrations-that-"
"are-not-backwards-compatible)里。如果数据库还标记着 2026-09-10 "
"之前已退役的旧迁移链，就无法直接升级；见[保留旧迁移链的数据库](operations.md#preserving-an-old-chain-"
"database)。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:97
msgid "When you add a migration"
msgstr "新增迁移时"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:99
msgid ""
"Add a row to the table above in the same pull request, saying what an "
"operator upgrading a live deployment needs to know: what existing rows it"
" changes, how long it can lock, and whether its downgrade refuses. Then "
"update the head revision named under *Before starting this release* and "
"in [ENVIRONMENT.md](../../ENVIRONMENT.md); a test checks that both name "
"the current head."
msgstr ""
"在同一个 pull request "
"里给上表加一行，写清楚升级线上部署的运维人员需要知道什么：会改动哪些已有数据、可能锁表多久、降级会不会被拒绝。然后把 *启动本次发布之前* 一节和"
" [ENVIRONMENT.md](../../ENVIRONMENT.md) 里写的 head 修订号也更新掉；有测试会检查这两处写的都是当前的"
" head。"
